---
title:    "Distributed Programming in a Multi-Paradigm Declarative Language"
citation: "(PPDP 1999)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PPDP99.html"
date:     1999-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes an extension of Curry to support distributed applications
where a dynamically changing number of different program units must be coordinated.